<title>USA: BHC Financial ends buyback program.</title>
<headline>BHC Financial ends buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BHC Financial said Wednesday it has terminated its previously implemented stock repurchase program.</p>
<p>The company also said its board declared its second quarter 1997 dividend of $0.03 per share payable to May 15 to stockholders of record on May 1.</p>
<p>It said the ex-dividend date was April 29.</p>
